    "Deletes Yoin's data from your iCloud for all devices, and turns sync off on them. Data on this device stays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从你的 iCloud 中删除所有设备的 Yoin 数据，并在其他设备上关闭同步。此设备上的数据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deletes this device's copy from your iCloud. If it's still syncing, it uploads again the next time it syncs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这会从你的 iCloud 中删除此设备的副本。如果该设备仍在同步，下次同步时会重新上传。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove %@ from cloud?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从云端移除 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops syncing this account and removes its data from %@ on all devices. Data on this device stays.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止同步此账号，并从 %@ 中移除所有设备上的对应数据。此设备上的数据会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is now signed in as a different account. Notes and ratings it synced before are removed from this device, and it syncs as the new account from now on. Your cloud copy and your other devices keep the old ones.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@”现在登录了另一个账号。此前同步的笔记与评分将从此设备移除，后续将作为新账号同步。你的云端副本与其他设备仍保留旧数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remove from cloud": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从云端移除"
          }
        }
      }
