            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除 %@ 中的旧副本？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yoin will back up %@ on this device first, then delete the old synced files there. Other devices that still use %@ will stop seeing updates from this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yoin 会先在此设备上备份 %1$@ 的数据，再删除其中的旧同步文件。仍在使用 %2$@ 的其他设备将不再收到此设备的更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud only syncs Apple devices. Any Android or HarmonyOS devices using Google Drive will stay on Drive and stop receiving updates from this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 仅同步 Apple 设备。正在使用 Google Drive 的 Android 或鸿蒙设备会继续留在 Drive，不再收到此设备的更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
